    [CI] update aisbench to v3.1-20260912-master (#17086)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    This PR updates the AISBench version to v3.1-20260912-master, and
    correspondingly adds the new requirements/response_anomaly.txt
    dependency to the install command across the nightly Dockerfiles,
    single-node E2E workflows, and the multi-node test documentation.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No. This is for internal nightly testing only.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    This patch was tested by running the image building stage of the
    existing nightly tests with the new AISBench tag, and verifying the
    response anomaly requirements are installed successfully.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
    Signed-off-by: duping <duping31@h-partners.com>

